---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ScriptIa from '../../components/scripts/ScriptIa.astro';
import ScriptIoi from '../../components/scripts/ScriptIoi.astro';
import PageIndex from '../../components/PageIndex.astro';
import PixelArrow from '../../components/PixelArrow.astro';
---
<Base
  lang="en"
  pagina="en/ai.html"
  titulo={"IOI · Artificial intelligence · Roger Avellana"}
  descripcion={"How Roger Avellana integrates artificial intelligence into design and marketing: process, tools, automation (n8n, Hermes Agent, OpenClaw, OpenAI Dots), AI agents and principles."}
  activa="ioi"
  colorTema="#0b0a16"
  claseBody="theme-ai"
>
  <PageIndex lang="en" secciones={[['top', 'Intro'], ['process', 'Process'], ['tools', 'Tools'], ['automation', 'Automation'], ['agents', 'Agents'], ['principles', 'Principles'], ['contact', 'Contact']]} oscuro />

  <main id="main">

    <!-- HERO IA -->
    <header class="ai-hero" id="top">
      <canvas class="neural-field" id="neural-field" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      <div class="ai-hero-grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="container ai-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="ai-eyebrow"><span class="ai-live"></span>IOI · artificial intelligence · active mode</span>
          <h1 class="aip-title">Design with judgment.<br /><span class="ai-gradient-text">Accelerated by AI.</span></h1>
          <p class="ai-lead">
            I integrate artificial intelligence into the creative process, automate repetitive tasks and design agents that carry out work step by step. AI proposes; judgment decides.
          </p>
          <div class="ai-actions">
            <a href="#process" class="btn ai-btn">See the process <PixelArrow /></a>
            <a href="about.html#contact" class="btn ai-btn-ghost">Let's talk</a>
          </div>
          <dl class="ai-meta">
            <div><dt>3</dt><dd>AI models in daily use</dd></div>
            <div><dt>4</dt><dd>AI-assisted process phases</dd></div>
            <div><dt>100%</dt><dd>decisions made with human judgment</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div class="ioi-perch" data-ioi="lab">
          <button type="button" class="ioi-bot" aria-label="IOI, Roger's AI copilot. Click to say hi">
            <canvas class="ioi-canvas" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
          </button>
          <p class="ioi-bubble" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <div class="ai-console" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="ai-console-bar">
            <span class="ai-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
            <span class="ai-console-title">roger@ioi ~</span>
            <span class="ai-model" id="console-model">claude</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ai-console-body">
            <p class="ai-line ai-line--user"><span class="ai-sign">›</span><span><span id="console-prompt">Suggest three concepts for a specialty coffee brand</span><span class="ai-cursor"></span></span></p>
            <p class="ai-line ai-line--bot"><span class="ai-sign ai-sign--bot">✦</span><span id="console-answer">1. "Origin": serif type and earthy tones. 2. "Ritual": warm minimalism. 3. "Roast": contrast and texture.</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="ai-console-foot">
            <span><span class="ai-live"></span><span id="console-status">response ready</span></span>
            <span id="console-tokens">42 tokens</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- PROCESO -->
    <section class="ai-section" id="process">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="ai-head">
          <span class="section-label"><b>01</b><span>process</span></span>
          <h2>Four phases. <span class="ai-gradient-text">One direction.</span></h2>
          <p>AI doesn't replace any phase of design: it speeds up the most time-consuming ones so the effort goes where it truly makes a difference.</p>
        </div>

        <ol class="ai-pipeline">
          <li class="ai-step">
            <span class="ai-step-num">01</span>
            <span class="ai-step-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" /><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3" /></svg></span>
            <h3>Explore</h3>
            <p>Market research, references and creative territories. AI widens the range; I choose what's worth developing.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="ai-step">
            <span class="ai-step-num">02</span>
            <span class="ai-step-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l1.8 4.6L18 9l-4.2 1.4L12 15l-1.8-4.6L6 9l4.2-1.4L12 3z" /><path d="M19 15l.8 2 2 .8-2 .8-.8 2-.8-2-2-.8 2-.8.8-2z" /></svg></span>
            <h3>Generate</h3>
            <p>Concept variants, copy, palettes and content structures in little time, to compare real options rather than hypotheses.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="ai-step">
            <span class="ai-step-num">03</span>
            <span class="ai-step-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 19l7-7 3 3-7 7-3-3z" /><path d="M18 13l-1.5-7.5L2 2l3.5 14.5L13 18l5-5z" /></svg></span>
            <h3>Refine</h3>
            <p>This is where craft takes over: typography, composition, brand tone and detail. AI assists; the final design is mine.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="ai-step">
            <span class="ai-step-num">04</span>
            <span class="ai-step-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v18h18" /><path d="M7 15l4-4 3 3 5-6" /></svg></span>
            <h3>Measure</h3>
            <p>Analysis of metrics and campaign results to understand what works and feed the next iteration.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HERRAMIENTAS -->
    <section class="ai-section" id="tools">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="ai-head">
          <span class="section-label"><b>02</b><span>tools</span></span>
          <h2>My AI <span class="ai-gradient-text">stack.</span></h2>
          <p>Three models, each with its own role. Choosing the right tool for each task is part of the judgment.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-tools">
          <article class="ai-tool" style="--tool: #e8834a;">
            <div class="ai-tool-top"><span class="ai-tool-dot"></span><span class="ai-tool-role">strategy &amp; writing</span></div>
            <h3>Claude</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Copy, scripts and brand tone</li>
              <li>Content structure</li>
              <li>Analysis and synthesis of information</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
          <article class="ai-tool" style="--tool: #3fbf8a;">
            <div class="ai-tool-top"><span class="ai-tool-dot"></span><span class="ai-tool-role">ideation</span></div>
            <h3>ChatGPT</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Brainstorming and concepts</li>
              <li>Message variants</li>
              <li>Rapid copy prototyping</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
          <article class="ai-tool" style="--tool: #8f88ff;">
            <div class="ai-tool-top"><span class="ai-tool-dot"></span><span class="ai-tool-role">research</span></div>
            <h3>Gemini</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Finding and cross-checking references</li>
              <li>Working with Google Workspace</li>
              <li>Document summaries</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AUTOMATIZACIÓN -->
    <section class="ai-section" id="automation">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="ai-head">
          <span class="section-label"><b>03</b><span>automation</span></span>
          <h2>Workflows that run <span class="ai-gradient-text">while you create.</span></h2>
          <p>I connect tools with AI to automate everyday repetitive tasks: drafts, reports, briefs. Always with a human review step before anything goes out.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-flow-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Automation examples">
          <button type="button" role="tab" class="ai-flow-tab" aria-selected="true" data-flow="0">Content</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" class="ai-flow-tab" aria-selected="false" data-flow="1">Reports</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" class="ai-flow-tab" aria-selected="false" data-flow="2">Briefs</button>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-flow" id="ai-flow" role="tabpanel">
          <div class="ai-node">
            <span class="ai-node-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2L4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7l1-8z" /></svg></span>
            <span class="ai-node-kind">trigger</span>
            <strong class="ai-node-text">New idea in the content calendar</strong>
          </div>
          <span class="ai-link" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span>
          <div class="ai-node ai-node--ai">
            <span class="ai-node-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l1.8 4.6L18 9l-4.2 1.4L12 15l-1.8-4.6L6 9l4.2-1.4L12 3z" /><path d="M19 15l.8 2 2 .8-2 .8-.8 2-.8-2-2-.8 2-.8.8-2z" /></svg></span>
            <span class="ai-node-kind">AI</span>
            <strong class="ai-node-text">Drafts copy and variants for each channel</strong>
          </div>
          <span class="ai-link" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span>
          <div class="ai-node ai-node--human">
            <span class="ai-node-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" /></svg></span>
            <span class="ai-node-kind">human review</span>
            <strong class="ai-node-text">I refine tone, message and design</strong>
          </div>
          <span class="ai-link" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span>
          <div class="ai-node">
            <span class="ai-node-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 2L11 13" /><path d="M22 2l-7 20-4-9-9-4 20-7z" /></svg></span>
            <span class="ai-node-kind">action</span>
            <strong class="ai-node-text">Post scheduled on social media</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-auto-list">
          <h3 class="ai-auto-title">What can be automated</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Metrics reports</li>
            <li>Content drafts</li>
            <li>Brief triage</li>
            <li>Template replies</li>
            <li>Asset organization</li>
            <li>Task tracking</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-platforms-head">
          <h3 class="ai-auto-title">Platforms &amp; agents</h3>
          <p>I choose the tool to fit the project: from visual workflows to autonomous agents that work
            on their own. With all of them I apply the same limits: <strong>minimal permissions, isolated
            environments and human review before acting.</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-platforms">
          <article class="ai-tool ai-platform" style="--tool: #f7b98a;">
            <div class="ai-tool-top"><span class="ai-tool-dot"></span><span class="ai-tool-role">workflow orchestration</span></div>
            <h3>n8n</h3>
            <p>Automation platform with a visual node editor. It connects hundreds of apps and services
              with AI steps, and can be self-hosted.</p>
            <ul class="ai-platform-tags"><li>low-code</li><li>self-hostable</li></ul>
          </article>
          <article class="ai-tool ai-platform" style="--tool: #3fbf8a;">
            <div class="ai-tool-top"><span class="ai-tool-dot"></span><span class="ai-tool-role">agent that learns</span></div>
            <h3>Hermes Agent</h3>
            <p>Open-source agent by Nous Research. It runs on your server, remembers across sessions and
              turns the tasks it solves into reusable skills.</p>
            <ul class="ai-platform-tags"><li>open source</li><li>memory</li></ul>
          </article>
          <article class="ai-tool ai-platform" style="--tool: #8f88ff;">
            <div class="ai-tool-top"><span class="ai-tool-dot"></span><span class="ai-tool-role">agent in your apps</span></div>
            <h3>OpenClaw</h3>
            <p>Open-source agent that connects to WhatsApp, Telegram, Slack or email and takes real
              actions from the conversation.</p>
            <ul class="ai-platform-tags"><li>open source</li><li>messaging</li></ul>
          </article>
          <article class="ai-tool ai-platform" style="--tool: #ece9ff;">
            <div class="ai-tool-top"><span class="ai-tool-dot"></span><span class="ai-tool-role">always-on agents</span></div>
            <h3>OpenAI Dots</h3>
            <p>ChatGPT agents that keep working after the conversation ends, with their own cloud
              computer and rules to ask for approval before acting.</p>
            <ul class="ai-platform-tags"><li>ChatGPT</li><li>cloud</li></ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AGENTES -->
    <section class="ai-section" id="agents">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="ai-head">
          <span class="section-label"><b>04</b><span>AI agents</span></span>
          <h2>Agents that <span class="ai-gradient-text">think in steps.</span></h2>
          <p>An agent doesn't just answer: it receives a goal, breaks it into steps, uses tools and carries out several tasks in a row. I design them to work within clear limits and always under supervision.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-agents-grid">
          <div class="ai-agent" id="ai-agent">
            <div class="ai-agent-bar">
              <span class="ai-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
              <span class="ai-agent-name">agent · market research</span>
              <button type="button" class="ai-agent-run" id="ai-agent-run">▶ Run</button>
            </div>
            <ol class="ai-agent-log">
              <li><span class="ai-agent-state"></span><span><b>Goal</b> Analyze 5 competitors of a specialty coffee brand</span></li>
              <li><span class="ai-agent-state"></span><span><b>Plan</b> search → comparison → synthesis</span></li>
              <li><span class="ai-agent-state"></span><span><b>Tool</b> web search · 5 brands identified</span></li>
              <li><span class="ai-agent-state"></span><span><b>Tool</b> social media analysis · tone, formats and frequency</span></li>
              <li><span class="ai-agent-state"></span><span><b>Synthesis</b> 3 differentiation opportunities found</span></li>
              <li><span class="ai-agent-state"></span><span><b>Review</b> report ready for approval</span></li>
            </ol>
            <div class="ai-agent-foot"><span id="ai-agent-status">ready to run</span><span id="ai-agent-steps">0 / 6 steps</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="ai-agent-types">
            <article class="ai-agent-type">
              <span class="ai-agent-type-key">research</span>
              <h3>Research agent</h3>
              <p>Analyzes competitors, trends and references, and delivers a summary with opportunities for the project.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="ai-agent-type">
              <span class="ai-agent-type-key">content</span>
              <h3>Content agent</h3>
              <p>Adapts a piece to each channel following the brand guidelines: formats, lengths and tone.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="ai-agent-type">
              <span class="ai-agent-type-key">analysis</span>
              <h3>Analytics agent</h3>
              <p>Reviews metrics regularly, spots changes and suggests adjustments for the next campaign.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PRINCIPIOS -->
    <section class="ai-section" id="principles">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="ai-head">
          <span class="section-label"><b>05</b><span>principles</span></span>
          <h2>How I work <span class="ai-gradient-text">with AI.</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-principles">
          <div class="ai-principle">
            <span class="ai-principle-key">01 · judgment</span>
            <h3>The decision is human</h3>
            <p>AI generates options; taste, the final decision and responsibility for the result are mine.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ai-principle">
            <span class="ai-principle-key">02 · transparency</span>
            <h3>No black boxes</h3>
            <p>I explain which parts of each project were done with AI and how, so the client always knows what they're getting.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ai-principle">
            <span class="ai-principle-key">03 · purpose</span>
            <h3>Speed with purpose</h3>
            <p>Saving time on the repetitive to invest it in what makes the difference: the idea, the detail and the strategy.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="ai-section ai-section--cta" id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="ai-cta">
          <span class="section-label"><b>06</b><span>next step</span></span>
          <h2>Shall we bring AI <span class="ai-gradient-text">to your brand?</span></h2>
          <p>Tell me about your project and let's see together where it can add the most: in the creative process, in content or in analysis.</p>
          <div class="ai-actions">
            <a href="mailto:roger.ar123@gmail.com" class="btn ai-btn">Email me <PixelArrow /></a>
            <a href="work.html" class="btn ai-btn-ghost">View projects</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
  <Fragment slot="scripts"><ScriptIa /><ScriptIoi /></Fragment>
</Base>
